Text:
fearlessMessage is a program that sends one Message to the 'single' manager, and prints the Answer of the 'single' manager on its standard output.
A Message about a folder holds the path of that folder.

Grammar:
Message ::= "EditMetadata ", Base16                            \
          | "Register ", Base16                                \
          | "Forget ", Base16                                  \
          | "Kind ", Base16, " ", Kind                         \
          | "Mount ", Base16, " ", TypeName, " ", ProjectName  \
          | "Unmount ", Base16, " ", TypeName                  \
          | "Attenuate ", Base16, " ", TypeName, (" ", TypeName)* \
          | "SelectMains ", Base16, (" ", TypeName)*
Base16 ::= "Base16:", ([0-9A-F][0-9A-F])+
Answer ::= "Applied\n" | "Refused\n", Error
Error ::= NoProjectAt | NotProjectsInfo
NoProjectAt ::= ...
NotProjectsInfo ::= ...

Well formedness:
in Message: all TypeName of a SelectMains are disjoint.
in Base16: second component is a valid OS FS path when decoded.

Story:
A event fearlessMessage is called with fearlessMessage "Message".
B action fearlessMessage sends Message to the 'single' manager.
C after fearlessMessage prints the Answer of the 'single' manager.
